[{:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-109881"] :question/problem "Which of the following are stochastic vectors?\n\n$$\nu=[\\begin{aligned}0.5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0.5\\end{aligned}],\\,v=[\\begin{aligned}-0.45 \\\\ 1.55\\end{aligned}],\\,w=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that a stochastic vector is a vector with nonnegative entries that add up to $1.$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our vectors in turn.\n\n- Vector $u$ is a stochastic vector. Indeed, \n\n- its entries are all nonnegative, and\n\n- the entries add up to one:\n\n$$\n0.5+0+0.5=1\n$$\n\n- Vector $v$ is *not* a stochastic vector since it contains negative entries.\n\n- Vector $w$ is *not* a stochastic vector since the entries do not add up to one:\n\n$$\n0+0=0\\ne 1\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$u$ only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-135485/selection/93198c2e65472148f49c73a47d70892e6efd0b46acbb489ee2afeea42a4a8c25" :answer/id #uuid "6afb012e-f43b-5f26-b7e5-bcaddcd5f573" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "None" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135485/selection/df20580b1de38ef466a084b8d688ddc41e251d771855d15d0ac63f41f71bfd19" :answer/id #uuid "bab50867-fb33-5144-a7b7-4401bc9c42cd" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$u$ and $w$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135485/selection/ca24b7775a2c615613d619247aea95c4ebeedd2f8b026330fbe0de9e7b94fe43" :answer/id #uuid "deed4926-2735-5948-a9f2-a013ce1428aa" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$u,$ $v,$ and $w$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135485/selection/943c19d914c72bdbb573870579ca24725a8b7607e28ae46984bace02edde3fdc" :answer/id #uuid "75e0b4e9-b4ba-5fa0-8c01-e169bc1d1c56" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$u$ and $v$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135485/selection/50dc037bcd603b3f900ac4f80f2cdcad5054db0eabfb8b0e3487575a41dc5b1f" :answer/id #uu