ing stochastic matrix as follows:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0.62 & 0.45 \\\\ 0.38 & 0.55\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-135556/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "abbdd778-7ace-5539-9d6f-cdf01804b237"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-135556"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-135565/selection/57f27b4de16f64fcab2f3b810a7087fb3b270a063a6807c410b738013ce41fde" :answer/id #uuid "ee00f827-07ae-5f2b-989e-c07f5addf3d7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135565/selection/0e8c61e1cbe5b6d4b3e52c0431e48b853c5faa01ca7ca0f5f9cf780292b06b1f" :answer/id #uuid "f0e1c674-7298-5cf6-b1c4-7864248e31b0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135565/selection/bc99aa5f3ee62c40cb834b274ce88683dbffd8fee8404db2b536df0189aa9cdc" :answer/id #uuid "78376574-492b-5e5f-a57f-809c997a9bd4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.75" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135565/selection/dca780037050aa95c2d1b94664a89f60783e6975fdfd83f31124b86bc8c78188" :answer/id #uuid "9fd55427-5528-5be3-893e-c5c17cfcb5b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.95" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135565/selection/55a4398ff2bb390f50308343800529dea9dc0d15acc52b6cb929bee17c075b16" :answer/id #uuid "ee7cb24b-3fa3-5d91-8915-efbde55bcc63" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1.4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135565/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "794c005a-3524-518c-807a-62738cd42c88" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-135565/selection/55a4398ff2bb390f50308343800529dea9dc0d15acc52b6cb929bee17c075b16" :answer-field/choices ["q-135565/selection/57f27b4de16f64fcab2f3b810a7087fb3b270a063a6807c410b738013ce41fde" "q-135565/selection/0e8c61e1cbe5b6d4b3e52c0431e48b853c5faa01ca7ca0f5f9cf780292b06b1f" "q-135565/selection/bc99aa5f3ee62c40cb834b274ce88683dbffd8fee8404db2b536df0189aa9cdc" "q-135565/selection/dca780037050aa95c2d1b94664a89f60783e6975fdfd83f31124b86bc8c78188" "q-135565/selection/55a4398ff2bb390f50308343800529dea9dc0d15acc52b6cb929bee17c075b16"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-135565" :question/id #uuid "1e83e16e-b8fd-55a5-9aa6-130410640d20" :question/math-academy-id "q-135565" :question/problem "A study shows that for a particular area in a specific season,\n\n- on a day that follows a day without precipitation, there is a $25%$ chance to have rain and a $35%$ chance to have snow.\n\n- on a day that follows a rainy day, there is a $40%$ chance not to have precipitation and a $5%$ chance to have snow.\n\n- on a day that follows a snowy day, there is a $50%$ chance not to have precipitation and a $5%$ chance to have rain.\n\nThe stochastic matrix that describes this situation is given below. What is the value of $a+b+c?$\n\n$$\nP=[\\begin{aligned}a & 0.4 & 0.5 \\\\ 0.25 & b & 0.05 \\\\ 0.35 & 0.05 & c\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We are given the following situation for this area:\n\n- On a day that follows a day without precipitation, there is a $25%$ chance to have rain and a $35%$ chance to have snow. This implies a $40%$ chance of not having precipitation on this day.\n\n- On a day that follows a rainy day, there is a $40%$ chance not to have precipitation and a $5%$ chance to have snow. This implies a $55%$ chance of having rain on this day.\n\n- On a day that follows a snowy day, there is a $50%$ chance not to have precipitation and a $5%$ chance to have rain. This implies a $45%$ chance of having snow on this day.\n\nWriting this information in tabular form, we obtain the following:\n\n|  |  | From: |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **No Precipitation** | **Rain** | **Snow** |\n| To: | **No Precipitation** | $0.4$ | $0.4$ | $0.5$ |\n| **Rain** | $0.25$ | $0.55$ | $0.05$ |  |\n| **Snow** | $0.35$ | $0.05$ | $0.45$ |  |\n\nWe can write the corresponding stochastic matrix as follows:\n\n$$\nP=[\\begin{aligned}0.4 & 0.4 & 0.5 \\\\ 0.25 & 0.55 & 0.05 \\\\ 0.35 & 0.05 & 0.45\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, we have\n\n$$\na+b+c=0.4+0.55+0.45=1.4.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-135565/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "abbdd778-7ace-5539-9d6f-cdf01804b237"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-135565"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-35843/selection/9ad211b7282b6a62800b97faf2e0e618e6d5dfc8a23af564a5e567f54d69e8d1" :answer/id #uuid "6f41ce78-bac1-5469-97b1-d4849b43ec7b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "|  |  | From: |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **Healthy** | **Sick** |\n| To: | **Healthy** | $0.62$ | $0.45$ |\n| **Sick** | $0.38$ | $0.55$ |  |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35843/selection/ea989b462391969ef30b496247177e2e4af920731a87276f7fe0f7fa84609322" :answer/id #uuid "a6adbf4c-76d5-5f42-ad73-395517c9758c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "|  |  | From: |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **Healthy** | **Sick** |\n| To: | **Healthy** | $0.45$ | $0.38$ |\n| **Sick** | $0.55$ | $0.62$ |  |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35843/selection/52b1c37aa2c75742bd7376c8343b0f05aca23e237e837bde25d6a17f94ce1407" :answer/id #uuid "af2c63a0-0d32-5df7-a3af-d413f0136b33" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "|  |  | From: |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **Healthy** | **Sick** |\n| To: | **Healthy** | $0.38$ | $0.45$ |\n| **Sick** | $0.62$ | $0.55$ |  |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-35843/selection/d08a6b3859542f339b5b876971e3f12fd7900d710c31d117c398e37d725d3b7c" :answer/id #uuid "c6296c7d-b32e-5926-8df8-d009908ac0e0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "|  |  | From: |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **Healthy** | **Sick** |\n| To: | **Healthy