nformation in tabular form, we obtain the following:\n\n|  |  | From: |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **Healthy** | **Sick** |\n| To: | **Healthy** | $0.62$ | $0.45$ |\n| **Sick** | $0.38$ | $0.55$ |  |\n\nNote that we can write a corresponding stochastic matrix as follows:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0.62 & 0.45 \\\\ 0.38 & 0.55\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-35843/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "abbdd778-7ace-5539-9d6f-cdf01804b237"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-35843"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-135554/selection/54ad075160f0ef7a2b7afce723e12d105791e391a039a80e98a7327dfa8ac108" :answer/id #uuid "940549cf-d44d-5a59-b03f-3ac2d3b64279" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "|  |  | From: |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **Ice-creams** | **Cakes** |\n| To: | **Ice-creams** | $0.35$ | $0.42$ |\n| **Cakes** | $0.65$ | $0.58$ |  |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135554/selection/758304d4ee3f02423aaaaf38904f0cc17450c4ac18a5b2021c55ca9106d1df24" :answer/id #uuid "b66a82ad-b1b5-52bd-bf3f-503669a2e570" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "|  |  | From: |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **Ice-creams** | **Cakes** |\n| To: | **Ice-creams** | $0.42$ | $0.65$ |\n| **Cakes** | $0.58$ | $0.35$ |  |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135554/selection/6cd3b17f687ad8f600d72549f3256dba2669cc5cde329b66f808868258fc998c" :answer/id #uuid "591279c4-6bcf-5d4b-82b5-3275b1c2211f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "|  |  | From: |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **Ice-creams** | **Cakes** |\n| To: | **Ice-creams** | $0.65$ | $0.58$ |\n| **Cakes** | $0.35$ | $0.42$ |  |" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135554/selection/8360f311d8c7001a9b85cc69cf98d62c7bee5ca7edd947201cb6c2430d4a381a" :answer/id #uuid "20660e89-d1b1-516f-85b5-56d5c2571b50" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answ