eams swap to cakes. This implies that $65%$ of them continue to prefer ice creams.\n\n- $42%$ of children who preferred cakes swap to ice creams. This implies that $58%$ of them continue to prefer cakes.\n\nWriting this information in tabular form, we obtain the following:\n\n|  |  | From: |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **Ice-creams** | **Cakes** |\n| To: | **Ice-creams** | $0.65$ | $0.42$ |\n| **Cakes** | $0.35$ | $0.58$ |  |\n\nNote that we can write a corresponding stochastic matrix as follows:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0.65 & 0.42 \\\\ 0.35 & 0.58\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-135554/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "abbdd778-7ace-5539-9d6f-cdf01804b237"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-135554"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-135447/selection/1cb4e7347e0448340b68c2cc2af4c662a29979ac3134b03095318fab97e8f2a3" :answer/id #uuid "d01f503c-4cf4-5ffb-a87b-a4bd71610170" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0.17 \\\\ 0.83\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135447/selection/95036ec26c01956e02ce107927450ce29f23eb3853a61bba79ff6c0b72c00a09" :answer/id #uuid "4692d91b-d06a-58c5-9403-ed111cf51359" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0.32 \\\\ 0.68\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135447/selection/1cdb72f0fd240edfdaf13d8978c1412418ca199ce4d77bf0d16b11b1ad79d1e3" :answer/id #uuid "4a0bbb9d-c64f-5d21-aa47-7f3f2e61237f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0.21 \\\\ 0.79\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135447/selection/fe0f7ed5bbf378a00bfbf1501e6f660f1556b3f2308c9e3844ab8defce6cd79e" :answer/id #uuid "2f64efc5-6550-59d6-90b3-26ce788f5f3f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0.23 \\\\ 0.77\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-135447/selection/05c